---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Luke Bayliss, a Melbourne software engineer working across software architecture, systems, and developer tooling.">
  <section class="about-hero site-container">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>I care about software that stays understandable after the interesting part is over.</h1>
    </div>
    <p class="about-hero__summary">
      I’m Luke Bayliss, a software engineer in Melbourne. My background is strongest in TypeScript and
      Node, with Go, .NET, architecture, delivery, and developer tooling making regular appearances.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="section-rule site-container about-grid">
    <section aria-labelledby="work-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">How I work</p>
      <h2 id="work-heading">Practical systems, deliberate trade-offs.</h2>
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>
          I enjoy turning unclear domains into maintainable systems: finding the useful boundaries,
          making trade-offs explicit, and leaving behind code that another person can safely change.
        </p>
        <p>
          I prefer evidence over confidence, simple tools over unnecessary platforms, and automation
          that removes repetition without hiding how the system works.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside aria-labelledby="interests-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Technical territory</p>
      <h2 id="interests-heading">Things I keep returning to</h2>
      <ul class="interest-list">
        <li>Software architecture and data-driven systems</li>
        <li>Developer experience and delivery</li>
        <li>Agents and practical automation</li>
        <li>Simulation, games, and emergent behaviour</li>
        <li>Technical communication and interactive explanation</li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <section class="section-rule site-container personal-section" aria-labelledby="elsewhere-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Away from the keyboard</p>
      <h2 id="elsewhere-heading">A few other things.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      Motorcycles, climbing, sim racing, home-gym tinkering, and a long-running interest in games where
      systems collide in unexpected ways. Some of that will inevitably find its way into the writing.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="contact-section">
    <div class="site-container contact-section__inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
        <h2>Say hello.</h2>
        <p>Email is best. For code and professional context, GitHub and LinkedIn are below.</p>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li><a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@lukebayliss.com">hello@lukebayliss.com</a></li>
        <li><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/lpbayliss" rel="me noreferrer">github.com/lpbayliss</a></li>
        <li><a class="text-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lpbayliss/" rel="me noreferrer">linkedin.com/in/lpbayliss</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(18rem, 0.65fr);
    gap: 3rem 6rem;
    align-items: end;
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 8rem);
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    max-width: 20ch;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5.5vw, 4.9rem);
  }

  .about-hero__summary {
    color: var(--site-foreground-muted);
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(18rem, 0.75fr);
    gap: 4rem 7rem;
    padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .about-grid h2,
  .personal-section h2,
  .contact-section h2 {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.7rem);
  }

  .about-copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--site-foreground-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .interest-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .interest-list li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--site-border);
    padding-bottom: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--site-foreground-muted);
  }

  .personal-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(15rem, 0.65fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 3rem 7rem;
    padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem);
  }

  .personal-section > p {
    max-width: 46rem;
    color: var(--site-foreground-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .contact-section {
    background: var(--site-surface-muted);
  }

  .contact-section__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 3rem 6rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);
  }

  .contact-section p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--site-foreground-muted);
  }

  .contact-section ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .about-hero,
    .about-grid,
    .personal-section,
    .contact-section__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about-hero,
    .about-grid,
    .personal-section {
      gap: 2.4rem;
    }
  }
</style>
